    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d309-a2">

                <pb facs="0567" n="507" sameAs="frus:frus1868p2/pg507"/>

                <opener><dateline rendition="#center">[From the Siglo XIX, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1868-05-26">May 26,
                        1868</date>.—Translation.]</dateline></opener>
                <head>Jalisco.</head>
                <p>The accusation of Mr. Gomez Cuervo, governor of the State of Jalisco, before the
                    general congress, has been very badly received in Guadalajara, and has led to
                    the issuance of the decree we insert below, and which reached here yesterday by
                    an extraordinary courier.</p>
            </div>
